# Inno Setup's language files ship with Windows (CRLF) line endings. Keep them
# byte-for-byte (no eol normalization) so the vendored ChineseSimplified.isl
# matches the official translation exactly and Inno's parser sees the shipped
# bytes; the repository-wide `* text=auto eol=lf` would otherwise rewrite CRLF
# to LF on checkin and silently diverge from the source.
*.isl -text
